WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
But I always said, the last 20 are going to be the hardest,

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.480
and that's exactly what happened.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.040
We have to get them back now.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.400
We don't want to get back two, and then another two,

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.320
and then one, and then three, have this process.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:12.400
No, we want them all back,

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.360
and we want the actually 38 dead bodies back, too.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.160
Those parents came to me, and they want them back,

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.760
and they want them back.

